WEBVTT

00:00:01.000 --> 00:00:06.000
FilmSub.lk — සිංහල උපසිරැසි සමඟ (Auto Sinhala Subtitles)

00:16:42.290 --> 00:16:44.790
They killed his soul!

00:16:46.760 --> 00:16:49.060
They cannot kill his soul.

00:16:49.800 --> 00:16:51.340
They did!

00:16:51.510 --> 00:16:53.640
They butchered him like an animal.

00:16:54.640 --> 00:16:57.350
They did not burn his body.

00:16:57.640 --> 00:17:02.350
He can never join his ancestors in the night lands.

00:17:03.440 --> 00:17:06.520
We will build him a funeral pyre.

00:17:13.490 --> 00:17:15.160
And I promise you,

00:17:15.660 --> 00:17:17.910
Rakharo will ride with his ancestors tonight.
